  s0: Not paired
  s1: Code waiting
  s2: Refused
  s3: Paired
  s4: Paired, signed out
  s5: Being checked
  s6: Unpaired while checked
  s7: Cleared to save
  s8: Cleared, then unpaired
  s9: Saved
  s10: Saved after unpair
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the person makes a pairing code
  s0 --> s2: the agent sends a write [not paired]
  s1 --> s0: the code runs out
  s1 --> s2: the agent sends a write [not paired]
  s1 --> s3: the agent pairs with the code
  s3 --> s0: the person unpairs the agent
  s3 --> s4: the agent's sign-in runs out
  s3 --> s5: the agent sends a write
  s3 --> s2: the agent sends a write [smart wallet on Ethereum]
  s4 --> s3: the agent signs in again
  s4 --> s0: the person unpairs the agent
  s4 --> s2: the agent sends a write [signed out]
  s5 --> s6: the person unpairs the agent
  s5 --> s7: the second check finds the same pairing
  s6 --> s2: the second check finds no pairing
  s7 --> s8: the person unpairs the agent
  s7 --> s9: the write is saved
  s8 --> s10: the write is saved
